"思考预算与自动压缩阈值通过环境变量 MAX_THINKING_TOKENS / CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE 写入 settings.json 的 env,新会话生效。" = "Thinking budget and auto-compact threshold are written to the env of settings.json via MAX_THINKING_TOKENS / CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE and apply to new sessions.";
"提供方由环境变量决定(CLAUDE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK / VERTEX / FOUNDRY),此处只读展示。OhMyAgent 不会读取或保存你的凭据。" = "The provider is determined by environment variables (CLAUDE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK / VERTEX / FOUNDRY) and is shown read-only here. OhMyAgent never reads or stores your credentials.";
"可在「Agent 扩展」页登记其他 ACP Agent。" = "Register other ACP Agents on the Agent Extensions page.";
"沙盒将命令限制在工作区与允许的网络范围内。详细的文件与网络白名单请在 settings.json 的 sandbox 字段中配置。" = "The sandbox confines commands to the workspace and allowed network scope. Configure detailed file and network allowlists in the sandbox field of settings.json.";
"语言在重新启动 OhMyAgent 后生效。" = "The language change takes effect after restarting OhMyAgent.";
"隐藏 Dock 图标时会自动开启菜单栏图标,以便仍可打开窗口。关闭最后一个窗口后,应用会继续在菜单栏中运行(⌘Q 退出)。" = "Hiding the Dock icon turns on the menu bar icon so you can still open windows. After the last window closes, the app keeps running in the menu bar (⌘Q to quit).";
"运行中的会话在菜单栏图标上显示闪烁的点;完成后点常亮,打开对应会话或点击通知后消失。" = "A running conversation shows a blinking dot on the menu bar icon; when finished the dot stays lit until you open it or click the notification.";
"发现新版本后在浏览器中下载 Developer ID 公证的安装包;发布源格式见 开发进度.md。" = "When a new version is found, download the notarized Developer ID package in your browser; see 开发进度.md for the feed format.";
"只重置 OhMyAgent 自身的偏好;Claude Code 的 settings.json 不受影响。" = "Only OhMyAgent's own preferences are reset; Claude Code's settings.json is untouched.";
"系统「减少透明度」「减少动态效果」始终优先。代码、Diff、编辑器等阅读区域恒为纯色,不受影响。" = "The system's \"Reduce Transparency\" and \"Reduce Motion\" always take precedence. Reading areas such as code, diffs and the editor are always solid and unaffected.";
"以上开关写入 settings.json 的 env,对新建会话生效。OhMyAgent 自身不包含任何遥测。" = "The switches above are written to the env of settings.json and apply to new sessions. OhMyAgent itself contains no telemetry.";
"脱敏会把用户目录替换为 ~,并抹去形如 sk-… / Bearer … 的字符串。" = "Redaction replaces the home directory with ~ and erases strings like sk-… / Bearer ….";
"OhMyAgent 不读取 Keychain 中的令牌,也不保存任何账号信息;登录与凭据完全由官方 claude 管理。" = "OhMyAgent does not read tokens from the Keychain or store any account information; sign-in and credentials are managed entirely by the official claude.";
"修改后对新建会话生效;已打开的会话保持原有进程。" = "Changes apply to new sessions; open sessions keep their existing process.";
"未开启的能力不会在 ACP initialize 中声明,Agent 使用自身实现。" = "Disabled capabilities are not declared in ACP initialize; the Agent uses its own implementation.";
"超过该行数的文件会强制换行并关闭复杂高亮以保持流畅(范围 2,000–200,000)。新打开的文件立即生效。" = "Files over this line count are force-wrapped with complex highlighting disabled to stay smooth (range 2,000–200,000). Applies immediately to newly opened files.";
"编辑器用于查看 Agent 改动的文件;保存时处理(去尾随空白等)将在编辑能力开放后提供。" = "The editor is for viewing files the Agent changed; on-save processing (trimming trailing whitespace, etc.) will come once editing is enabled.";
"开启后 Claude 的命令会在客户端终端里运行并实时显示输出;对已打开的窗口在重新连接后生效。关闭时由 claude 自己执行命令。" = "When on, Claude's commands run in the client terminal with live output; for open windows it applies after reconnecting. When off, claude runs commands itself.";
"超出上限时丢弃最早的输出(在字符边界截断)。范围 64–16,384 KB。" = "When the limit is exceeded, the oldest output is discarded (cut at a character boundary). Range 64–16,384 KB.";
"关闭后只保留 PATH、HOME、USER、SHELL、LANG、TERM 等基础变量,可避免把令牌等敏感变量暴露给命令。" = "When off, only basic variables such as PATH, HOME, USER, SHELL, LANG and TERM are kept, so tokens and other secrets are not exposed to commands.";
"预算提醒只在客户端侧判断:会话费用超过阈值时在用量弹层中高亮。订阅账号通常不上报费用。" = "Budget alerts are evaluated client-side: when a conversation's cost exceeds the threshold it is highlighted in the usage popover. Subscription accounts usually don't report cost.";
"任何实现 ACP 的 Agent 都可以加入(命令 + 参数 + 环境变量)。切换 Agent 在窗口工具栏进行,会在当前窗口开始新会话。" = "Any ACP-compatible Agent can be added (command + arguments + environment variables). Switch Agents from the window toolbar; it starts a new conversation in the current window.";
"启用后,这些 Agent 会以 stdio MCP 服务器的形式注入新会话,让当前 Agent 把子任务委托给另一个 Agent(例如 `codex mcp-server`)。对新会话生效。" = "When enabled, these Agents are injected into new sessions as stdio MCP servers so the current Agent can delegate subtasks to another Agent (e.g. `codex mcp-server`). Applies to new sessions.";
"每个会话在本机创建一个仅当前用户可访问的 Unix socket,通过 `OhMyAgentBridge` 垫片以 MCP 服务器 `ohmyagent` 暴露:打开文件、显示改动、读取你在输入框中选中的文字、发送系统通知。会话结束即关闭。" = "Each session creates a Unix socket on this machine accessible only to the current user, exposed through the `OhMyAgentBridge` shim as the MCP server `ohmyagent`: open files, show changes, read the text you selected in the composer, and send system notifications. It closes when the session ends.";
"选中的提供商对「新建会话与重新连接」生效。每个会话启动时由 OhMyAgent 把地址、模型与密钥交给 Claude Code,不会改动 ~/.claude/settings.json,也不影响终端里的 claude。" = "The selected provider applies to new sessions and reconnects. On each session start OhMyAgent passes the endpoint, model and key to Claude Code; it does not modify ~/.claude/settings.json or affect claude in your terminal.";
"密钥保存在 ~/Library/Application Support/OhMyAgent/provider-keys.json(权限 0600),只在启动会话时放进 Claude Code 进程的环境变量,不写入日志。" = "Keys are stored in ~/Library/Application Support/OhMyAgent/provider-keys.json (mode 0600) and only placed in the Claude Code process environment when a session starts; they are never logged.";
"日志文件位于 ~/Library/Logs/OhMyAgent/(单文件 10MB 轮转,保留 7 天)。令牌、API Key 与授权头在写入前自动脱敏。排查问题时把 oma-日期.log 发给开发者即可。" = "Logs live in ~/Library/Logs/OhMyAgent/ (rotated at 10MB per file, kept for 7 days). Tokens, API keys and authorization headers are redacted before writing. To report an issue, send the oma-<date>.log to the developer.";
"诊断包包含版本、工具路径、配置概要(仅键名)、最近 Agent 日志与计时,不含对话内容与凭据。" = "The diagnostics bundle contains versions, tool paths, a config summary (key names only), recent Agent logs and timings — no conversation content or credentials.";
